DELETE /repos/{owner}/{repo}/actions/policies/{policy_id}
Delete an Actions policy for a repository.
Required: owner (path) — The account owner of the repository. The name is not case sensitive.; repo (path) — The name of the repository without the `.git` extension. The name is not case sensitive.; policy_id (path) — The ID of the policy.

GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/actions/policies/{policy_id}
Get a specific Actions policy for a repository.
Required: owner (path) — The account owner of the repository. The name is not case sensitive.; repo (path) — The name of the repository without the `.git` extension. The name is not case sensitive.; policy_id (path) — The ID of the policy.

PUT /repos/{owner}/{repo}/actions/policies/{policy_id}
Update an Actions policy for a repository. Omitting `workflow_path` preserves the policy's existing workflow targeting.
Required: owner (path) — The account owner of the repository. The name is not case sensitive.; repo (path) — The name of the repository without the `.git` extension. The name is not case sensitive.; policy_id (path) — The ID of the policy.; body (body) — Request body
